4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should prioritize the human element of these plans. I will look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not letting us repeat old mistakes. I'll check the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and those two pilots from eight years ago to see what actually worked.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the hidden risks and the approval process. I will look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think it's important to know where the money is actually going. I'll look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see if the complaints match the reality! I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go. This should be fun!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. @Takumi, do you think the older records will provide a clear enough baseline for our current options?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, definitely. People forget things too fast around here. If we don't look at the actual results from the past, we're just guessing. I'll find out if those ideas are actually new or just recycled.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your approach is logical. I am interested to see if the failures you find correlate with the structural or administrative hurdles I expect to uncover in the committee minutes.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Toshio. I just hope that by looking at the ledger and the fees, we can avoid any arguments about the budget later on.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, don't be so worried! We'll figure the money part out. I'm just excited to see if the passengers are actually waiting as long as they say they are!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate the optimism, @Sakura, but we must remain grounded. I am concerned that without sufficient staffing, even the most efficient route or system will fail in practice.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, you're right about the staff, but a plan that's doomed to fail because it failed ten years ago is a waste of people's time too. We need the full picture.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The full picture requires knowing not just what failed, but why. I suspect the gap between the drawings and the delivery is where the real risk lies. I will wait for the data.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just don't want us to commit to something we can't actually afford in the long run. I hope the ledger shows we have a stable way to pay for these improvements.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, @Takumi, you both sound so serious! But if we find out where the time is actually being lost, maybe we can pick a plan that makes everyone happy and smiling!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,We have each defined our focus. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring these facts back to the table and make a rational decision.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready. Let's get the facts and stop the guessing games. I'll see what the records have to say.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us see what the records reveal. I will be looking for the discrepancies that usually remain hidden until it is too late.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do my best to find the information we need. I hope it helps us make a choice that doesn't cause too many problems later.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I can't wait to see what's hidden in those reports! I'll find the truth about the crowds and the waiting times. Let's go, everyone!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
